WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
No me, I'm always alone

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
dead he is dead

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
My girlfriend is dead. He is dead.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
I've been hiding in the tree

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
How long have you been following us?

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Two days. I mean no harm.

7
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
I see you seem to know the way

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,740
So I followed secretly

9
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:17,740
do you want to join us

10
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:18,740
is it ok

11
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,740
Don't fall behind, don't make unnecessary noises

12
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:21,740
Otherwise die

13
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:24,730
This guy can follow us for so long

14
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:26,730
I think he has some strength.

15
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:28,760
We have too few people now

16
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:36,490
One more person means more strength

17
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:39,350
Xiaoling, bring the bottle

18
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:50,790
Keep one bottle and go.

19
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:53,560
Hasn’t the service area arrived yet?

20
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:55,560
Is that the service area?

21
00:00:55,560 --> 00:01:00,890
Let’s take a closer look first
